  // 01 05 01 0B 80 01
  // 80 is the SerialAPI Setup command byte - in this case SERIAL_API_SETUP_CMD_NODEID_BASETYPE_SET
  // 01 for this example is the command result - in this case, OK (requested node ID base type successfully set)

